# Function source mutation sensitivity (PLAN-1096)

The canonical author of the source-change sensitivity family. Every case
carries ONE Auto source; the `av` check runs the ordinary AV language chain
(`ac-av/language-source-run-v1`).

## Case: source-mutation-sensitive
id: "av.parity.1096.source-mutation-sensitive"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1096", "functions"]
links: ["PLAN-1096"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn twice(x int) int { return x * 3 }
fn main() int { return twice(21) }
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
caps: ["ac.source.language.av/v1", "console.stdout", "console.stderr"]
exit: 63

